<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's oil prices unchanged in June.</title>
<headline>Morocco's oil prices unchanged in June.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's monthly industrial fuel price in June stood unchanged from May at 1,662.9 dirhams ($175) per tonne, Morocco's energy minister said.</p>
<p>Gas oil and kerosene prices were also unchanged respectively at 4.86 dirhams and 3.24 dirhams a litre, the ministry said.</p>
<p>Pump prices of super and ordinary petrol remained unchanged at 7.65 dirhams and 7.42 dirhams a litre respectively.</p>
<p>($ = 9.45 dirhams)</p>
